{
    "background_story": "Titan was a majestic stallion, known for his strength and endurance on the racing track. However, his life took a dramatic turn when he was diagnosed with cytopenia, a condition characterized by low blood cell count. His owner, a young and ambitious trainer, was devastated by the news. But she refused to give up on Titan, and instead, worked closely with veterinarians to develop a customized treatment plan. With time, patience, and care, Titan slowly began to recover. Though he would never regain his former racing glory, he found a new purpose as a therapy horse, helping children with similar health struggles. Titan's resilience and gentle nature inspired countless people, and his story served as a testament to the power of compassion and determination in the face of adversity.",
